# Dataset files are NOT committed — they are generated or downloaded on demand
# via scripts/setup_data.sh. Only READMEs and the scripts live in git.
#
# Rationale: the .xyz/.pdb data is ~350 MB and bloats history. Tier 1 (CH4) is
# bit-reproducible from scripts/03_generate_ch4.py; Tier 2/3 are downloaded and
# checksum-verified (scripts/checksums.txt).
#
# Data is ignored by extension (not by directory) so the per-directory
# README.md files stay tracked and keep the layout documented.

*.xyz
*.pdb
*.cif

# hosted archive (downloaded, then extracted + removed)
*.tar.xz
*.tar.gz

# scratch
temps/
